{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p122","text":"趙氏之系，與秦同祖。周穆平徐，乃封造父。帶始事晉，夙初有土。岸賈矯誅，韓厥立武。寶符臨代，卒居伯魯。簡夢翟犬，靈歌處女。胡服雖強，建立非所。頗、牧不用，王遷囚虜。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"趙氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職稱與匿名詞保留；未名者不補熟知姓名。述贊省稱限本篇對讀，不另增加事件或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"周穆","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002240","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"造父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002239","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"帶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002245","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"夙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002248","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"岸賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002273","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002275","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"伯魯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002308","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"簡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002292","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"靈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"處女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職稱與匿名詞保留；未名者不補熟知姓名。述贊省稱限本篇對讀，不另增加事件或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"頗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002439","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002481","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m122-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"王遷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002490","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:p002","text":"韓厥，晉景公之三年，晉司寇屠岸賈將作亂，誅靈公之賊趙盾。趙盾已死矣，欲誅其子趙朔。韓厥止賈，賈不聽。厥告趙朔令亡。朔曰：「子必能不絶趙祀，死不恨矣。」韓厥許之。及賈誅趙氏，厥稱疾不出。程嬰、公孫杵臼之藏趙孤趙武也，厥知之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"晉景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002625","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"屠岸賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002626","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002666","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002666","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"趙朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002667","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisi